# 📘 1. Mathematics Formula Sheet

### Percentage

* Percentage = (Value / Total) × 100

### Profit & Loss

* Profit = SP − CP
* Loss = CP − SP
* Profit % = (Profit / CP) × 100

### Simple Interest

* **SI = (P × R × T) / 100**

### Average

* **Average = Sum ÷ Number of Terms**

### Speed, Distance & Time

* Speed = Distance ÷ Time
* Distance = Speed × Time
* Time = Distance ÷ Speed

### Time & Work

* One day's work = 1 ÷ Total days

### HCF & LCM

* **HCF × LCM = Product of the two numbers**

